    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Have you ever heard of Siri*? Have you ever seen a self-driving car*? Why do you think you can "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "unlock",
            "zh": "解锁"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " your phone by just showing your face? These are all because of AI!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Artificial intelligence*, or AI, is the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ability",
            "ref": "v-ability"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for a computer to think and learn. Just like we do!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When you see a dog, you can tell how it is different from other animals. It’s easy for you, because you’ve seen many other dogs before. AI "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "programmes",
            "zh": "程序"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " work the same way."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "People show an AI programme thousands of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "images",
            "ref": "v-image"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of dogs. The AI programme then "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "analyses",
            "ref": "v-analyse"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "compares",
            "ref": "v-compare"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " these images. It can teach itself the differences between dogs and other animals."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "AI can help us in many ways. You can ask a virtual assistant* to tell you the weather. Or you can ask it to play music or to turn on the lights."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When you buy something "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "online",
            "ref": "v-online"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", AI may send you "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "ads",
            "zh": "广告"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "similar",
            "ref": "v-similar"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " things."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "AI is all around us. We should learn more about it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "note",
        "title": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Did you know?"
          }
        ],
        "content": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "*苹果智能语音助手（Siri），可以帮助用户查找信息、拨打电话、发送消息、获取路线、播放音乐、查找苹果设备等。"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "*自动驾驶汽车（self-driving car），又称无人驾驶汽车，是一种通过电脑系统实现无人驾驶的智能汽车。"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "*人工智能（artificial intelligence/AI），一种模拟人类智能思维的技术。通过这种技术，计算机可以完成许多复杂的任务，如图像识别、语音识别、自然语言处理、决策制定等。"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "*虚拟助手（virtual assistant），一种嵌入在智能手机和其他联网设备中的智能软件，可以基于命令替个人执行任务或提供服务。"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
